    "shown": "The JSON array of shown values that the approval request carries.",
    "canonical": "The RFC 8785 (JCS) serialization of `shown`. It is held here as a JSON string: the canonical text is the value a JSON parser returns for it.",
    "digest": "The SHA-256 of the UTF-8 encoding of the canonical text, in lowercase hexadecimal: the digest the request carries and a decision repeats."
